%% Nestorria - Clerk signup sequence (JWT -> provisioning)
sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Guest
  participant R as React app
  participant C as Clerk
  participant S as Spring API
  participant B as BearerToken JWT
  participant F as UserProvisioningFilter
  participant V as UserService
  participant D as Postgres nestorria
  U->>R: open app
  R->>C: sign in
  C-->>R: JWT
  R->>S: GET profile with JWT
  S->>B: authenticate bearer token
  B->>C: fetch JWKS if cache miss
  C-->>B: public keys
  B-->>S: claims authenticated
  S->>F: provision user
  F->>V: provision user
  V->>D: upsert User
  D-->>V: ok
  V-->>F: USER role
  F-->>S: authenticated
  S-->>R: 200 profile
